questions.explanation:
由 $\alpha(x)$ 与 $\beta(x)$ 是非零且不相等的等价无穷小量,得 $\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)}{\beta(x)}=1,\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\beta(x)}{\alpha(x)}=1,\alpha(x)\neq 0,\beta(x)\neq 0$ 且 $\alpha(x)\neq\beta(x)$,从而
$$\lim_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)+\beta(x)}{\alpha(x)}=\lim_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)}{\alpha(x)}+\lim_{x \to 0}\frac{\beta(x)}{\alpha(x)}=1+1=2,$$
故 $\alpha(x)+\beta(x)\sim 2\alpha(x)$,不是“=”,①错误;
同理,$\alpha(x)+\beta(x)\sim 2\beta(x)$,从而②错误;
$\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)-\beta(x)}{\alpha(x)}=\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)}{\alpha(x)}-\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\beta(x)}{\alpha(x)}=1-1=0$,③正确;
$\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)-\beta(x)}{\beta(x)}=\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\alpha(x)}{\beta(x)}-\lim\limits_{x \to 0}\frac{\beta(x)}{\beta(x)}=1-1=0$,④正确.
